@startuml
title BattleStage - 메인 배틀 루프 흐름도

start

:InitStage(userData, stageData);
:Spawn Player & Monsters;
:Init Boards & UI Pools;
:Start Battle Loop;

while (isBattleActive?) is (yes)
  :Add ATB ticks to all units (AddATBTick);

	while (readyQueue not empty?) is (yes)
	:Dequeue ready unit (readyQueue.Dequeue);
	if (attacker is PlayerUnit?) then (yes)
	  :Create Puzzle boards for player (board.FillBoard / StartBoardTimer);
	  fork
		:Player solves puzzle or waits until board timer expires;
	  fork again
		:Board timer counts down (Board.StartBoardTimer -> OnPuzzleExpired);
	  end fork
	  if (Puzzle Completed?) then (yes)
		:OnPuzzleCompleted(result) -> build PuzzleResult (SkillList, TargetList);
	  else (expired)
		:OnPuzzleExpired(result) -> build PuzzleResult (monster pattern or default attack);
	  endif
	else (monster)
	  :Monster creates defensive board (Factory.GetBoard) and starts timer;
	  :When board timer ends -> OnPuzzleExpired / OnPuzzleCompleted -> enqueue result;
	endif
  endwhile

  if (resultQueue not empty?) then (yes)
	:Dequeue Result;
	:Process Skill/Attack sequence;
	:ApplyDamage / ApplyStatus to targets;
	if (target HP <= 0?) then (yes)
	  :Handle Death (IEPlayAction(Death) -> Release resources);
	endif
	if (All Monsters Dead?) then (yes)
	  :Trigger OnStageClear -> break loop;
	endif
	if (All Players Dead?) then (yes)
	  :Trigger OnStageDefeat -> break loop;
	endif
  endif

  :Frame yield / WaitForNextTick;
endwhile (no)

:ReleaseStage();
stop

note right
  주요 이벤트:
	- readyQueue: ATB가 차면 유닛이 진입 (Unit.OnATBReady -> readyQueue.Enqueue)
  - resultQueue: 퍼즐 완료/만료 또는 몬스터 패턴으로부터 생성 (OnPuzzleCompleted/OnPuzzleExpired -> resultQueue.Enqueue)
  - 퍼즐은 결과 생성 지연(유예시간) 역할
end note

@enduml
